  "body": "Set on an impressive 893m² freehold site, this substantial 388m² Geoff Luke architect-designed residence offers a remarkable combination of architectural character, privacy, versatility and resort-style family living in the heart of Kohimarama.\r\n\r\nBeautifully crafted from masonry, weatherboard and cedar, this is a home of generous proportions, thoughtfully designed for families who value space, effortless entertaining and the flexibility to accommodate every stage of life.\r\n\r\nFrom its expansive living areas and beautiful harbour views to the heated swimming pool and private outdoor entertaining spaces, every aspect of this home invites you to enjoy an exceptional lifestyle.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n\r\n• 893m² freehold site -generous grounds, privacy and space to enjoy.\r\n\r\n• 388m² architect-designed residence - distinctive character and substantial proportions.\r\n\r\n• 4 generous bedrooms plus study/5th bedroom - flexibility for growing families.\r\n\r\n• 3 bathrooms, including 2 ensuites - comfort and convenience throughout.\r\n\r\n• 4 separate living areas - exceptional versatility for entertaining, relaxing and family life.\r\n\r\n• Heated swimming pool, sun-soaked terrace and generous lawn - your own private resort.\r\n\r\n• Beautiful American oak flooring, gas fireplace and seamless indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\n• Luxurious master retreat - sweeping harbour views and its own private lounge.\r\n\r\n• Self-contained one-bedroom apartment - ideal for extended family, guests or independent teenagers.\r\n\r\n• 4-car garaging plus 4 additional secure off-street parks - exceptional space for vehicles, guests and the boat.\r\n\r\nPrime Kohimarama location - moments from the beach, waterfront cafés, Eastridge and everything the Eastern Bays lifestyle has to offer.\r\n\r\nFew properties offer this combination of generous land, expansive living, architectural individuality, independent accommodation, resort-style outdoor entertaining and outstanding parking.\r\n\r\nExperience the space, discover the lifestyle and see for yourself what makes this property so special.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing. .",
